latch_vdd: F8 (R75), the form that reaches the simulators today: latch.sim with its outer axis on the supply (vdd 5, 5.1, a stepped sweep) instead of rin over a list, which no rule converts yet
load "spice/mos1.osdi"
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
model nm sp_mos1 type=1.0 vto=1.0 kp=1e-4
model pm sp_mos1 type=-1.0 vto=-1.0 kp=1e-4
vdd (vdd 0) vsource dc=5.0
vin (in 0) vsource dc=0.0
rin (in a) resistor r=10k
rf (c a) resistor r=20k
m1p (b a vdd vdd) pm w=10u l=1u
m1n (b a 0 0) nm w=10u l=1u
m2p (c b vdd vdd) pm w=10u l=1u
m2n (c b 0 0) nm w=10u l=1u
control
  sweep outer instance="vdd" parameter="dc" from=5.0 to=5.1 step=0.1
    sweep inner instance="vin" parameter="dc" from=2.0 to=5.0 step=0.5
      analysis dc1 op
endc
